---
// Static inline SVG, site tokens only, no ids/markers. All values come from the code shown next to the figure in the post.
---
<figure class="gp7w">
  <div class="gp7w-scroll">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 900 372" role="img" aria-label="Top: main prints and returns, the program exits, and the goroutine may be cut off before it prints. Bottom: main blocks in wg.Wait() until the three workers have called Done.">
<text x="20" y="24" class="h"><tspan data-lang-en>Without a wait: main returns first</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Không chờ: main kết thúc trước</tspan></text>
<text x="20" y="64" class="lane"><tspan data-lang-en>main</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>main</tspan></text>
<text x="20" y="120" class="lane"><tspan data-lang-en>goroutine</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>goroutine</tspan></text>
<rect class="bar" x="150" y="48" width="300" height="24" rx="3"/>
<text x="300.0" y="65.0" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>Println("main is done"), then return</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Println("main is done"), rồi return</tspan></text>
<line class="vline red" x1="450" y1="40" x2="450" y2="140"/>
<text x="462" y="64" class="badtx"><tspan data-lang-en>program exits</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>chương trình thoát</tspan></text>
<rect class="wait" x="190" y="104" width="260" height="24" rx="3"/>
<text x="320.0" y="121.0" class="mute" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>Println("hello from the goroutine")</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Println("hello from the goroutine")</tspan></text>
<text x="462" y="120" class="mute"><tspan data-lang-en>may be cut off before it prints</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>có thể bị cắt trước khi in kịp</tspan></text>
<line class="vline" x1="190" y1="76" x2="190" y2="104"/>
<text x="202" y="95" class="mute"><tspan data-lang-en>go statement</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>câu lệnh go</tspan></text>
<text x="20" y="194" class="h"><tspan data-lang-en>With a WaitGroup: main waits at wg.Wait()</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Dùng WaitGroup: main chờ ở wg.Wait()</tspan></text>
<text x="20" y="235" class="lane"><tspan data-lang-en>main</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>main</tspan></text>
<text x="20" y="273" class="lane"><tspan data-lang-en>worker 1</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>worker 1</tspan></text>
<text x="20" y="311" class="lane"><tspan data-lang-en>worker 2</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>worker 2</tspan></text>
<text x="20" y="349" class="lane"><tspan data-lang-en>worker 3</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>worker 3</tspan></text>
<rect class="bar" x="150" y="218" width="150" height="24" rx="3"/>
<text x="225.0" y="235.0" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>Add(1), go, ×3</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Add(1), go, ×3</tspan></text>
<rect class="wait" x="300" y="218" width="340" height="24" rx="3"/>
<text x="470.0" y="235.0" class="mute" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>blocked in wg.Wait()</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>bị chặn ở wg.Wait()</tspan></text>
<rect class="bar" x="640" y="218" width="220" height="24" rx="3"/>
<text x="750.0" y="235.0" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>all workers finished</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>all workers finished</tspan></text>
<rect class="bar" x="300" y="256" width="220" height="24" rx="3"/>
<text x="410.0" y="273.0" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>worker 1</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>worker 1</tspan></text>
<text x="528" y="273" class="mute"><tspan data-lang-en>Done</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Done</tspan></text>
<rect class="bar" x="300" y="294" width="340" height="24" rx="3"/>
<text x="470.0" y="311.0" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>worker 2</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>worker 2</tspan></text>
<text x="648" y="311" class="mute"><tspan data-lang-en>Done</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Done</tspan></text>
<rect class="bar" x="300" y="332" width="130" height="24" rx="3"/>
<text x="365.0" y="349.0" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>worker 3</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>worker 3</tspan></text>
<text x="438" y="349" class="mute"><tspan data-lang-en>Done</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Done</tspan></text>
<line class="vline" x1="640" y1="212" x2="640" y2="362"/>
<text x="652" y="349" class="mute"><tspan data-lang-en>counter reaches 0</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>bộ đếm về 0</tspan></text>
  </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption><span data-lang-en>Time runs left to right. Top: the program ends when main returns. Bottom: Wait blocks until the counter is back at zero. Bar lengths are illustrative; the order in which workers finish changes from run to run.</span><span data-lang-vi>Thời gian chạy từ trái sang phải. Trên: chương trình kết thúc khi main return. Dưới: Wait chặn cho tới khi bộ đếm về 0. Độ dài thanh chỉ để minh họa; thứ tự các worker xong thay đổi theo từng lần chạy.</span></figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .gp7w { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .gp7w-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .gp7w svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .gp7w text { font-size: 14px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .gp7w .h { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .gp7w .lane { fill: var(--text-muted); font-weight: 600; }
  .gp7w .bar { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .gp7w .wait { fill: none; stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.2; stroke-dasharray: 4 3; }
  .gp7w .bad { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.2; stroke-dasharray: 4 3; }
  .gp7w .badtx { fill: var(--red); font-weight: 700; }
  .gp7w .mute { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .gp7w .strong { fill: var(--text); font-weight: 600; }
  .gp7w .vline { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .gp7w .vline.red { stroke: var(--red); }
  .gp7w .grid { stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1; }
  .gp7w .arrow { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .gp7w .num { font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .gp7w figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
